  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core contribution to ECDPM 2026-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperation agreement between the MFA and the European Centre for Development Policy Management (ECDPM) functions as core contributions to the ECDPM&apos;s activities (research, publications, seminars, dialogue, sparring). The Danish MFA has granted DKK 4,000,000 for 2026-2027 of which 2,000,000 will be contributed in 2026. Apart from Denmark, the ECDPM has a number of other institutional partners from European Member States.</narrative>
  </description>
